# tests/qemu/scripts/test-edition-stage1.keys
#
# `seed-uefi-test` has no landing launcher (SPEC §4.2: it is the rehearsal
# edition, not the product surface) — it boots the watermark banner and drops
# straight into Stage 1 PREPARE. This script proves the test-edition image
# boots, watermarks itself, and renders the redesigned Stage 1 checklist; the
# SPEC §11.2 virtualization gate stops it at the same place it stops the
# production edition (see production-launcher-and-gates.keys for why).

DELAY 90

ECHO test-edition banner / Stage 1
SHOT 01-test-edition-boot
KEY 1 2 3
WAIT 1
SHOT 02-stage1-checked
KEY ENTER
WAIT 5
SHOT 03-gates-refusal
